<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WESTERN AUSTRALIA BEAT TASMANIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WESTERN AUSTRALIA BEAT TASMANIA.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australia beat Tasmania by seven wickets on the fourth and final day of their Sheffield Shield match at Bellerive Oval in Hobart on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Tasmania 314 (Jamie Cox 96) and 175 (Tom Moody seven for 41); Western Australia 312 (Mike Hussey 83) and 180 for three (Mike Hussey 87)</p>
